{"id":"9167d626040602f0","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-hypersimple-simple.md","title":"超简单集是简单集","display":"thm-hypersimple-simple — 超简单集是简单集","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-hypersimple-simple","aliases":["43-thm-hypersimple-simple"],"display":"thm-hypersimple-simple — 超简单集是简单集","depends_on":["[[43-df-hypersimple]]","[[43-df-immune]]","[[43-df-strong-array]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.14 hyperimmune sets; §5.9 simplicity","source_printed_pages":"59,28–30","source_pdf_pages":"79,48–50","source_scope":"book-derived","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false,"revision_round":"2026-10-15-round2"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-hypersimple-simple"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-hypersimple-simple</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hypersimple-simple — 超简单集是简单集"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c204d52497e7421\" href=\"?note=3c204d52497e7421\" title=\"43-df-hypersimple\">43-df-hypersimple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"385194286158f758\" href=\"?note=385194286158f758\" title=\"43-df-immune\">43-df-immune</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4d5075bfcb91a90c\" href=\"?note=4d5075bfcb91a90c\" title=\"43-df-strong-array\">43-df-strong-array</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.14 hyperimmune sets; §5.9 simplicity"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"59,28–30"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"79,48–50"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book-derived"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-15-round2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hypersimple}\">\\(\\operatorname{Hypersimple}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Simple}\">\\(\\operatorname{Simple}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Immune}\">\\(\\operatorname{Immune}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3c204d52497e7421\" href=\"?note=3c204d52497e7421\" title=\"43-df-hypersimple\">43-df-hypersimple</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"385194286158f758\" href=\"?note=385194286158f758\" title=\"43-df-immune\">43-df-immune</a>；强数组见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4d5075bfcb91a90c\" href=\"?note=4d5075bfcb91a90c\" title=\"43-df-strong-array\">43-df-strong-array</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hypersimple}(A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Simple}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Hypersimple}(A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Simple}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若A的补集含无限c.e.子集W，按枚举找到一个严格递增的可计算序列w_i∈W。单点族F_i={w_i}构成强数组，且每项都遇到补集，与补集超免疫性矛盾。补集无穷性已包含在定义中。</p>\n<p>来源：所供2007-07-28草稿，§5.14 hyperimmune sets; §5.9 simplicity，印刷页59,28–30，PDF页79,48–50。本项为书内讨论的笔记内推导；未冒充原书逐字陈述。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-hypersimple","status":"resolved","id":"3c204d52497e7421","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-hypersimple]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-immune","status":"resolved","id":"385194286158f758","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-immune]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-strong-array","status":"resolved","id":"4d5075bfcb91a90c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-strong-array]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hypersimple","status":"resolved","id":"3c204d52497e7421","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{Hypersimple}$、$\\operatorname{Simple}$、$\\operatorname{Immune}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-hypersimple]]、[[43-df-immune]]；强数组见 [[43-df-strong-array]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-immune","status":"resolved","id":"385194286158f758","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{Hypersimple}$、$\\operatorname{Simple}$、$\\operatorname{Immune}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-hypersimple]]、[[43-df-immune]]；强数组见 [[43-df-strong-array]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-strong-array","status":"resolved","id":"4d5075bfcb91a90c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{Hypersimple}$、$\\operatorname{Simple}$、$\\operatorname{Immune}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-hypersimple]]、[[43-df-immune]]；强数组见 [[43-df-strong-array]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hypersimple}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Simple}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Immune}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hypersimple}(A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Simple}(A).","display":true}],"bytes":1460,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1"